# A short landscape phone (844 x 390, DPR 3) by finger: Score Chase from its setup, the palette as a column beside the
# board, a swatch and a touched cell, the left drawer, pause and leave.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 600 Paint the table
frames 10
touch =Score Chase
until 120 Same seed for everyone this week
frames 10
save chase-setup-land
touch =Start chase
until 600 0:00
frames 40
touch Color 1,
frames 10
save chase-land
touch =◧
frames 15
expect Fill every cell
save drawer-land
touch 50% 50%
frames 10
touch =Pause
until 60 Skip animations
frames 10
touch =Leave round
until 60 Progress on this canvas will be lost
frames 10
touch =Confirm
until 120 Paint the table
